Supervisor is open until filled through the court's online applicant tracking system. The Project Manager gave first consideration to applicants who applied within the first 14 days of its 28 October 2026 posting, so readers should check the live MassCareers listing before applying.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>The listings don't state how many posts there are for each role and give no interview dates or start dates. The Project Manager and the seasonal posts don't state a salary in the versions we checked. None of the listings indicate whether visa sponsorship is available so international applicants should check directly with the agency before applying.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> MA state and federal court applications are free and no agency will ever ask you to pay anything for an application, an assessment or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://www.onetonline.org/link/jobinfo?id=C7EAF1C17B41408A9FCE2220D70B7996206">O*NET OnLine</a> (the Massachusetts Digital Evidence Analyst listing: salary, deadline and application route); <a href="https://www.map.uscourts.gov/sites/map/files/Vacancy%2026-05_Adminitrative%20Operations%20Supervisor_Re-Opened2026.pdf">US Courts</a> (the Administrative Operations Supervisor vacancy notice: salary, location and open-until-filled status); <a href="https://www.onetonline.org/link/jobinfo?id=F4A245C086D34396A44F64675084BEB0206">O*NET OnLine</a> (the DCAMM Project Manager listing: duties and experience requirements).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Is the Boston Digital Evidence Analyst role still open?</h3><p>No, the application deadline was 24th November 2026 at 5pm Eastern Time.</p><h3>How do I go about applying for the Attorney General posts?</h3><p>Apply directly via the Attorney General's Office employment portal at mass.gov/ago/employment. Applications submitted via MassCareers will not be accepted.</p><h3>What's the highest paying Boston role in this list?</h3><p>The Administrative Operations Supervisor at $67,652 to $131,826 per annum.</p><h3>Is the court role open until filled?</h3><p>Yes, the Administrative Operations Supervisor vacancy is open until filled.</p>
