(gen_random_uuid(), 'jobs-in-us-bank-20261127', 'usa', 'USA',
'Jobs in US Bank: 1,019 Open Roles Pay $76,000 to $250,000',
'Jobs in US Bank: 1,019 Open Roles Pay $76,000 to $250,000',
'Jobs in US Bank number 1,019 open roles as of 22 November 2026, with sales posts at $115,000 to $250,000 a year and Relationship Bankers from $24.92 an hour.',
'Jobs in US Bank number 1,019 open roles as of 22 November 2026, with sales posts at $115,000 to $250,000 a year and Relationship Bankers from $24.92 an hour.',
$$<p>U.S. Bank is hiring at scale, with 1,019 open roles on its careers board as of 22 November 2026. Jobs in US Bank in this roundup span legal, finance, sales and branch banking, with posted pay from $24.92 an hour to $250,000 a year.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>U.S. Bank</td></tr><tr><td>Post</td><td>Relationship Banker I, SBA Credit Analyst 5, Credit Analyst 5, Data Analytics Consultant, Treasury Management Project Manager, Software Engineer 2, Client Manager, Operations Manager 5</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>$24.92 an hour to $250,000 a year, depending on the role</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Listings live in November 2026; SBA Credit Analyst recruitment runs 23 November to 24 December 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through the U.S. Bank careers site on Workday</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>Varies by role; bachelor's degree for analyst and manager posts, 10 or more years of experience for Operations Manager 5</td></tr><tr><td>Selection</td><td>Online application and assessment; applications open through Workday</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What jobs in US Bank involve</h2><p>The largest hiring groups are Legal (433 open vacancies), Finance (268), and Sales (67). Relationship Bankers build relationships with customers in person, by appointment and virtually, giving counsel with a digital-first mindset. The SBA Credit Analyst 5 works on small business lending; the Data Analytics Consultant in Atlanta pays $93,000 to $109,000, the Treasury Management Project Manager in Cincinnati pays $76,000 to $89,000, and the Software Engineer 2 in Atlanta pays $98,000 to $116,000. Sales openings include payment sales consultants who sell treasury management, merchant services, commercial cards, liquidity, and foreign exchange, as well as mortgage sales supervisors and institutional business development roles. Readers looking more widely can browse <a href="https://growentix.cloud/usa">USA jobs</a> and our guide to <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/caregiver-jobs-in-usa-for-foreigners-visa-pay-and-how-to-apply-20261026">caregiver jobs in the USA for foreigners</a>.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>Relationship Banker roles are open to applicants with customer service and banking experience, while analyst, consultant and engineer posts need a bachelor's degree and relevant professional experience. The Operations Manager 5 post needs 10 or more years of experience. The SBA Credit Analyst role requires working from a U.S. Bank location three or more days a week. The listings do not state any nationality restriction, but applicants must be authorised to work in the United States.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>Pay varies sharply by role. Sales openings pay $115,000 to $250,000 a year, with a midpoint of $145,000, and account executives within that group pay $131,000 to $250,000. The SBA Credit Analyst 5 pays $98,345 to $115,700, the Credit Analyst 5 pays $92,820 to $109,200, the Data Analytics Consultant pays $93,000 to $109,000, and the Software Engineer 2 pays $98,000 to $116,000. The Relationship Banker I in Lakewood, Washington, pays $24.92 to $30.46 an hour. Across the 420 vacancies that state a salary, the range runs from $98,000 to $157,000, with a median of $124,000. U.S. Bank offers incentive and recognition programmes, a 401(k) contribution, a pension and an employee stock purchase plan.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply via the U.S. Bank careers site (which will open the applications on Workday). The SBA Credit Analyst 5 hire commenced on 23 November 2026 and has an expiry date of 24 December 2026. The Relationship Banker I in Lakewood has an expiry date of 26 November 2026. Most of the roles have no closing date and are open until filled so it would be advisable to apply as early as possible rather than waiting for a closing date.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>The listings provide no post counts for individual roles and give no interview dates or start dates. Only 41% of the 1,019 vacancies list a salary so the pay range for many of the roles is not available in the listings we checked. None of the listings indicate whether visa sponsorship is available so international applicants should check directly with U.S. Bank prior to applying.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> U.S. Bank applications are free and the bank will never ask you to pay anything for an application, an assessment or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://alion.io/company/usbank-com/jobs">Alion</a> (U.S. Bank careers board read 22 November 2026: 1,019 open jobs, salary range and hiring by function); <a href="https://donutapply.com/companies/usbanknationalassociation/">DonutApply</a> (U.S. Bank National Association openings as of 26 November 2026: 360 open US jobs and median pay); <a href="https://salesjobs.now/platforms/u-s-bank">SalesJobs.Now</a> (U.S. Bank sales openings as of 27 November 2026: 51 roles and pay bands).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>How many jobs does U.S. Bank have currently open?</h3><p>1,019 open roles as of 22 November 2026 (360 of which were open US roles as of 26 November 2026).</p><h3>What is the highest paid group at U.S. Bank?</h3><p>Sales, at $115,000 to $250,000 a year, with a midpoint of $145,000.</p><h3>How much does a Relationship Banker earn?</h3><p>The Lakewood, Washington, post pays $24.92 to $30.46 an hour.</p><h3>Where do I apply?</h3><p>Apply online via the U.S. Bank careers site (which opens the application in Workday).</p>
$$,
