es. Only 41% of the 1,019 vacancies list a salary so the pay range for many of the roles is not available in the listings we checked. None of the listings indicate whether visa sponsorship is available so international applicants should check directly with U.S. Bank prior to applying.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> U.S. Bank applications are free and the bank will never ask you to pay anything for an application, an assessment or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://alion.io/company/usbank-com/jobs">Alion</a> (U.S. Bank careers board read 22 November 2026: 1,019 open jobs, salary range and hiring by function); <a href="https://donutapply.com/companies/usbanknationalassociation/">DonutApply</a> (U.S. Bank National Association openings as of 26 November 2026: 360 open US jobs and median pay); <a href="https://salesjobs.now/platforms/u-s-bank">SalesJobs.Now</a> (U.S. Bank sales openings as of 27 November 2026: 51 roles and pay bands).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>How many jobs does U.S. Bank have currently open?</h3><p>1,019 open roles as of 22 November 2026 (360 of which were open US roles as of 26 November 2026).</p><h3>What is the highest paid group at U.S. Bank?</h3><p>Sales, at $115,000 to $250,000 a year, with a midpoint of $145,000.</p><h3>How much does a Relationship Banker earn?</h3><p>The Lakewood, Washington, post pays $24.92 to $30.46 an hour.</p><h3>Where do I apply?</h3><p>Apply online via the U.S. Bank careers site (which opens the application in Workday).</p>
