(gen_random_uuid(), 'black-friday-2026-deals-store-hours-20261127', 'news', 'USA',
'Black Friday 2026: store hours and best deals guide',
'Black Friday 2026: store hours and best deals guide',
'Black Friday 2026 falls on 27 November, with Walmart, Target, Best Buy and Amazon all open early and deals running through Cyber Monday on 30 November.',
'Black Friday 2026 falls on 27 November, with Walmart, Target, Best Buy and Amazon all open early and deals running through Cyber Monday on 30 November.',
$$<p>Black Friday 2026 falls on Friday 27 November, with most major US retailers opening at 6 am and deals running through the weekend to Cyber Monday on 30 November, after sales that started early on 19 November.</p>

<table>
<tr><td>Date</td><td>Friday 27 November 2026</td></tr>
<tr><td>Amazon</td><td>Sale 19-30 November; new deals at midnight and 8am PST on Black Friday</td></tr>
<tr><td>Best Buy</td><td>Sale 19-28 November; stores 6am-10pm on Black Friday</td></tr>
<tr><td>Target</td><td>Sale 22-29 November; stores open 6am on Black Friday</td></tr>
<tr><td>Walmart</td><td>Online from 12.01am ET; stores 6am local time</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cyber Monday</td><td>Monday 30 November 2026</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>What happened</h2>

<p>Black Friday no longer starts on Thanksgiving and this year the biggest sales were actually well underway over a week before the actual Black Friday. Amazon's Black Friday sale started on Thursday 19th November and runs through Cyber Monday 30th November with new deals coming out at 12.01am and 9am Pacific on Black Friday (according to the <a href="https://www.redding.com/story/money/2026/11/26/black-friday-sales-in-redding-what-to-see-at-macys-target-walmart/92944018007/">Redding Record Searchlight</a>). Best Buy kicked off their sale on the same day with ten days of doorbuster deals and most stores will be open from 6am to 10pm on Black Friday.</p>

<p>Target's initial wave of Black Friday deals concluded on 7th November, though the company has confirmed that it will be introducing a new set of limited time offers every weekend throughout the holidays and a new Deal of the Day every day until 24th December. On Black Friday Target stores open at 6 am and the first 100 eligible customers at each store will be given a gift card of $25, $50 or $100, with one customer at each store receiving a $1,000 gift card, according to <a href="https://www.thestreet.com/retail/when-walmart-target-costco-and-other-major-retailers-open-on-black-friday">TheStreet</a>. Walmart's Black Friday kicks off at 12.01 am ET online and at 6 am in stores with thousands of gifts under $20 and 25 toys under $25.</p>

<p>Among the headline offers, Best Buy is selling a TCL 65-inch television for $229.99, saving $240; an HP OmniBook 5 laptop for $449.99; and Sony noise-cancelling headphones for $169. At the same time, My Best Buy members can buy a $100 gift card for $60 in-store on Black Friday, <a href="https://www.usatoday.com/story/shopping/deals/black-friday/2026/11/20/shop-black-friday-sales-events-2026/92881272007/">USA Today</a> reported. Amazon is offering up to 35 per cent off its own devices and up to $600 off selected Sony and Hisense televisions.</p>

<h2>What the Black Friday 2026 deals mean</h2>

<p>This year's Black Friday is very much a ten day event rather than a one day thing so the way you go about it is very different. The best prices are often online before the stores even open and the in-store doorbusters (Best Buy's $60 gift card, Target's gift card giveaway) are very much limited and go away very quickly. Costco doesn't have universal special Black Friday hours (though some of the clubs will be open early) and Walgreens will be running regular hours with no Black Friday specific deals on at all.</p>

<p>Shoppers should also check before they go as the hours and the deals can vary from location to location and of course the stock can sell out. The sales go on Saturday 28th November with many of the same deals still in play and again on Cyber Monday 30th November when Amazon and others will be launching a second wave of deals. Seasonal hiring for the rush is covered in our <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/amazon-holiday-jobs-300000-seasonal-20261121">Amazon holiday jobs</a> report and the latest from the wider world is in our <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles">News</a> section.</p>

<h2>What the sources do not say</h2>

<p>None of the sources will tell you that any particular deal is going to be in stock (though a number of them will note that the offer is while supplies last and may be subject to change). There is no single figure given for how much people will spend this Black Friday or how this year's sales will stack up against last year's. It's also not stated whether every store in a chain will be operating on the hours listed so you'll need to check local hours prior to making a special trip.</p>

<p>Sources: <a href="https://www.thestreet.com/retail/when-walmart-target-costco-and-other-major-retailers-open-on-black-friday">TheStreet</a> for store hours and offers at the nine major retailers; <a href="https://www.usatoday.com/story/shopping/deals/black-friday/2026/11/20/shop-black-friday-sales-events-2026/92881272007/">USA Today</a> for the best sales and their dates; <a href="https://www.redding.com/story/money/2026/11/26/black-friday-sales-in-redding-what-to-see-at-macys-target-walmart/92944018007/">Redding Record Searchlight</a> for the early sales, the Target gift card giveaway and the Best Buy doorbusters.</p>

<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>

<h3>When is Black Friday 2026?</h3>
<p>Friday 27 November 2026. Sales kicked off early on 19th November at Amazon and Best Buy and go through to Cyber Monday 30th November.</p>

<h3>What time do the stores open on Black Friday?</h3>
<p>Walmart, Target and Best Buy stores generally open at 6 am local time. Walmart's online sale starts at 12.01 am ET, and Amazon drops new deals at midnight and 8 am Pacific.</p>

<h3>What is the best Black Friday deal this year?</h3>
<p>There is no single best deal, and offers sell out fast. Headline prices include a TCL 65-inch television for $229.99 at Best Buy and up to 35 per cent off Amazon devices.</p>
