$$<p>Ella Langley Choosin Texas 29 weeks at No. 1 is now the story of the Billboard Hot 100, as the song extends its record with a 29th week at the summit on the chart dated 28 November 2026. That's a record in itself. It also equates to the most weeks at No. 1 by an artist in a single calendar year (same as Drake's record) and it's all been achieved with one song.</p>

