<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
<h3>How many weeks has Choosin' Texas been at No.1 on the Hot 100?</h3>
<p>29 weeks on the chart as of the 28th November 2026 — a record for a single on the Hot 100 (which launched in August 1958).</p>
<h3>What record does Ella Langley now share with Drake?</h3>
<p>Most weeks at No.1 by an artist in a single calendar year: 29. Drake achieved the record in 2018 with three songs. Langley equalled it with just "Choosin' Texas".</p>
